    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n8371" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀνεπί-δῐκος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			<div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>without the process of</i>
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐπιδικασία,</span> by which claims to
			inheritance or guardianship were enforced, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν τά πατρῷα</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Is.
					3.59
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παραλαμβάνειν ἀ. τὴν ἀγχιστείαν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					8.34
				</span></i>
			 (cj.); 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀ. ἔχειν κλῆρον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					D.
					46.22
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				3.33
			</span></i>.</div>
